          "message": {
            "text": "Text pseudo paint boxes now use the measured Blink border-box dimensions, with reconstruction retained only for older serialized trees. The browser oracle compares capture against an equivalent real box containing variables, calc, vertical writing, and pseudo-specific typography, while five focused pseudo regressions protect existing positioning, transform, and emoji behavior.",
            "markdown": "Text pseudo paint boxes now use the measured Blink border-box dimensions, with reconstruction retained only for older serialized trees. The browser oracle compares capture against an equivalent real box containing variables, calc, vertical writing, and pseudo-specific typography, while five focused pseudo regressions protect existing positioning, transform, and emoji behavior."
          },
